# Arcum's Weathervane's second ability, paid with exactly {2} and a tap, makes a nonsnow basic land of either player snow,
# keeping it basic (CR 205.4b, the ruling); it can't target a dual land, which has basic land types but is not basic, nor a
# land already snow (the ruling). A land the first ability made nonsnow is a nonsnow basic land again, and the later
# effect makes it snow: same layer, timestamp order (CR 613.1d, 613.7). The first ability takes snow from any snow land, a
# nonbasic legendary one too, which stays legendary (CR 205.4b, the rulings).
